WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:16.006
Zann watched the blob make its way toward the group.

2
00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:20.218
"Do you think this thing can swallow a person?" he muttered to Perda.

3
00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:25.341
Perda gulped. "I don't know, and I have no intention of finding out."

4
00:00:25.342 --> 00:00:29.325
The blob spread out and formed a circle around the group.

5
00:00:29.326 --> 00:00:35.030
Then it started moving inward, forcing the group into a smaller and smaller space.

6
00:00:35.031 --> 00:00:38.298
"Everyone, keep together!" ordered Vig.

7
00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:42.596
Zann looked for an escape, but he didn't see one—they were surrounded.

8
00:00:42.597 --> 00:00:47.171
Zing was by Zann's feet, chattering nervously. Zann had an idea.

9
00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:50.078
"Zing," Zann whispered. "Sing!"

10
00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:53.041
Zing leaped into the air and began whistling.

11
00:00:53.042 --> 00:00:59.129
Zann held his breath, hoping the song would distract the creature. But the blob kept closing in.

12
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:03.336
"Maybe it doesn't work on creatures from other worlds," Darb said.

13
00:01:03.337 --> 00:01:07.133
Zing stopped his song and let out a whistle of frustration.

14
00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:10.929
Then he swooped down, shooting flames at the blob.

15
00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:14.442
To Zann's astonishment, the flames didn't burn the blob.

16
00:01:14.443 --> 00:01:19.336
Instead they were absorbed into the creature, making it grow even bigger.

17
00:01:19.337 --> 00:01:28.766
Then something strange happened. The blob started to move away from Zann and the others, eagerly catching every flame Zing shot at it.

18
00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:34.498
As it moved away, the circle it had formed was broken, and the blob no longer surrounded the group.

19
00:01:34.499 --> 00:01:37.852
Still shooting flames, Zing started flying away.

20
00:01:37.853 --> 00:01:44.979
The blob followed, absorbing all the fire it could, growing bigger each time it devoured a new flame.

21
00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:48.828
"That thing is getting enormous," Darb said nervously.

22
00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:53.959
"Yeah," said Zann. "It's also getting farther away. Follow me!"

23
00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:58.435
Zann bolted for the closest door and wound up in a deserted sitting room.

24
00:01:58.436 --> 00:02:02.700
A second later Perda, Gliss, and Darb were right beside him.

25
00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:08.907
Zann looked back at Zing. His pet dragon was still flying above the blob, shooting flames at the creature.

26
00:02:08.908 --> 00:02:14.831
Fala, Shem, Vig, and the others were running through a door at the other end of the entrance hall.

27
00:02:14.832 --> 00:02:17.950
"It looks like everyone's safe," Zann reported.

28
00:02:17.951 --> 00:02:20.900
"But that blob is bigger than ever!"

29
00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:26.667
"Let's get going," Darb said. "We don't know how fast it can move if it decides to chase us!"

30
00:02:26.668 --> 00:02:31.674
Zann whistled for Zing, who stopped breathing fire and flew to him right away.

31
00:02:31.675 --> 00:02:38.409
Then they all ran down a hallway until they were sure they'd left the blob far behind.

32
00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:42.599
"Where are we?" Darb wondered, after they'd stopped to catch their breath.

33
00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.853
"I've seen that painting of the king and queen before." Gliss pointed.

34
00:02:46.854 --> 00:02:50.812
"I think we're near the suite where Rixa and the others locked us in."

35
00:02:50.813 --> 00:02:53.580
"We should look for the dungeon," said Zann.

36
00:02:53.581 --> 00:02:56.567
"If that blob thing tells Morb we're here—"

37
00:02:56.568 --> 00:03:03.234
"How can it do that?" Perda interrupted with a laugh. "It doesn't have a mouth!"

38
00:03:03.235 --> 00:03:10.121
Meanwhile Gliss was walking ahead. "Here's the suite," she called, pushing open a door and peering in.

39
00:03:10.122 --> 00:03:13.541
"Oh! Is that the magic-sucking machine?"

40
00:03:13.542 --> 00:03:17.069
Zann, Perda, and Darb all looked into the room.

41
00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:23.225
In the center was a large contraption made of bones, books, stones, and other items.

42
00:03:23.226 --> 00:03:26.821
"No," said Zann. "This is something else."

43
00:03:26.822 --> 00:03:30.420
He looked at the grinning white skull perched on top.

44
00:03:30.421 --> 00:03:34.327
"Look! There's a map of Magica above that skull."

45
00:03:34.328 --> 00:03:37.766
"What are those red dots on the map?" Darb wondered.

46
00:03:37.767 --> 00:03:43.168
"I don't know," said Perda. "It looks like they're all clustered around the palace."

47
00:03:43.169 --> 00:03:49.529
Gliss gasped. "Morb's prisoners are in the palace—the red dots must be Reds!"

48
00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:56.487
"This machine is probably what Morb has been using to track us—and all the other Reds," said Zann.

49
00:03:56.488 --> 00:04:00.059
"I bet if we destroy it, we can use magic again!"

50
00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:05.772
Zann rushed into the room, grabbed a metal candlestick, and began hitting the machine with it.

51
00:04:05.773 --> 00:04:09.764
His friends joined in, using whatever objects they could find.

52
00:04:09.765 --> 00:04:12.686
"Look out!" Darb shouted suddenly.

53
00:04:12.687 --> 00:04:20.156
Spinning around, Zann saw a flock of tiny dragons zipping into the room. They swarmed the kids, stinging them.

54
00:04:20.157 --> 00:04:24.271
"Ignore them!" Zann called. "We have to—ouch!"

55
00:04:24.272 --> 00:04:30.470
One of the dragons had stung his hand. Zann dropped the candlestick, and it rolled under the machine.

56
00:04:30.471 --> 00:04:34.122
Zann looked around for another weapon, but he didn't see anything.

57
00:04:34.123 --> 00:04:37.532
He was about to kick the machine when he had a better idea.

58
00:04:37.533 --> 00:04:42.039
Standing on tiptoe, he reached up and grabbed the skull off the top.

59
00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:48.351
The map instantly blinked out of existence, and a strong shock of energy sizzled through Zann's entire body.

60
00:04:48.352 --> 00:04:53.442
Sparks swirled all around him, and his eyes began to feel strange.

61
00:04:53.443 --> 00:04:59.169
As he gripped the skull, energy jumped off his hands, and power surged through him.

62
00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:03.130
"Zann!" Perda shouted. "Your eyes are glowing!"

63
00:05:03.131 --> 00:05:06.981
Zann didn't answer—he had never felt so powerful.

64
00:05:06.982 --> 00:05:11.368
He took one hand off the skull and pointed it at the machine.

65
00:05:11.369 --> 00:05:17.008
Instantly a Blast spell shot from his hand, and the machine exploded.

66
00:05:17.009 --> 00:05:22.337
Perda, Darb, and Gliss shielded their faces as pieces flew everywhere.

67
00:05:22.338 --> 00:05:27.054
Then Zann heard Gliss scream as another tiny dragon stung her.

68
00:05:27.055 --> 00:05:33.733
Zann pointed at the nearest dragon. Another Blast spell shot out, even more powerful than the last.

69
00:05:33.734 --> 00:05:38.505
Gliss screamed again, jumping away just in time to avoid the blast.

70
00:05:38.506 --> 00:05:44.040
The spell vaporized several of the dragons—along with all the furniture that had been behind them.

71
00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:48.161
"Zann!" Perda cried. "What's happening to you?"

72
00:05:48.162 --> 00:05:55.392
"What do you mean?" asked Zann. He could feel magical energy shooting all around him like fireworks.

73
00:05:55.393 --> 00:06:00.925
"I've never felt better!" A new rush of energy coursed through his body.

74
00:06:00.926 --> 00:06:06.362
Zann sent out more Blast spells, obliterating every tiny dragon he saw.

75
00:06:06.363 --> 00:06:10.586
Soon the entire room had been reduced to a pile of rubble.

76
00:06:10.587 --> 00:06:14.957
Sunlight poured in through the holes Zann had made in the exterior wall.

77
00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:18.057
Perda and Gliss stared in horror.

78
00:06:18.058 --> 00:06:28.240
"It's that skull!" Darb exclaimed. "Zann, you have to drop it!"
